OL,3,AMan convicted after being caught on
OL,4,ACCTV upskirting girl in shopping centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has pleaded guilty to filming
OL,7,Fbeneath a young girl's skirt in a
OL,8,Fshopping centre before running off and
OL,9,Flater being tracked down on CCTV.
OL,11,FAlex Allegretto, 39, admitted the
OL,12,Foffence of operating a mobile phone
OL,13,Fbeneath the clothing of another person
OL,14,Ffor the purpose of obtaining sexual
OL,15,Fgratification.
OL,17,FPolice were called to St David's 2
OL,18,Fshopping centre on the morning of 7
OL,19,FJuly after a mother reported
OL,20,FAllegretto, who was unknown to them,
OL,21,Ffor upskirting her daughter.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
